# Scene hazard-pushable (test/README.md): the Hazard Course crate in
# t0a0a, test/m5/crate-pit.route with shots: func_pushable #156 (*67)
# stands 40 u east of the pit (x 1248..1352, floor -256); the player walks
# into it from the east for 4 s, it slides off the ledge, falls and rests
# on the pit floor against the west wall (GoldSrc: fixture
# physics-movetypes/P-botpush t0a0a walk_0, from 1.24 s). Shot `overview`
# looks at the pit and the ledge from the west side whether the crate fell
# or not; `pit` from above the crate.
startmap t0a0a
waitmap t0a0a 60
god 1
setpos 1475 -1016 -135 0 180
wait 1
stats begin
shot before
+forward
wait 0.5
shot pushing
wait 3.5
-forward
setpos 1180 -1016 -136 20 0
wait 0.5
shot overview
waitclass func_pushable -144 0 -84 0.5 0
setpos 1400 -1016 -136 45 180
wait 0.5
shot pit
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
